      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ERAPE.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake half fyges and half raisins pike them and waisshe them in water skalde them in wine. Bray them in a morter, and draw them though a strainer. Cast them in a pot and therwith powder of pepper and oother good powders. alay it up with flour of Rice. And colour it with sanders, salt it. \u0026 present it forth.\u003Cbr\u003E"
